ube.com/watch?v=swXWUfufu2w</a></p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"마무리\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#%EB%A7%88%EB%AC%B4%EB%A6%AC\" aria-label=\"마무리 permalink\" class=\"anchor before\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a>마무리</h2>\n<p>인생 과제들을 조금 정리해가는 듯 싶더니</p>\n<p>그동안 누적된 스트레스에 몸이 단단히 고장나고 말았다.</p>\n<p>나약한 인간에 비해 인생은 너무 어려워 😞</p>","timeToRead":5,"frontmatter":{"title":"10월 4주차 기록","date":"October 27, 2024","description":"10월도 참 길다","tags":["weekly"],"disqus":null},"fields":{"langKey":"en"}}},"pageContext":{"slug":"/weekly/2024-10-week-4/","previous":{"fields":{"slug":"/weekly/2024-10-week-5/","langKey":"en","directoryName":"weekly"},"frontmatter":{"date":"November 03, 2024","description":"다시 쓰러지고 다시 회복중 🤧","title":"10월 5주차 기록","tags":["weekly"]}},"next":{"fields":{"slug":"/weekly/2024-10-week-3/","langKey":"en","directoryName":"weekly"},"frontmatter":{"date":"October 20, 2024","description":"돌아버린 일교차 🥶","title":"10월 3주차 기록","tags":["weekly"]}},"previousInSameTag":{"fields":{"slug":"/weekly/2024-10-week-5/","langKey":"en","directoryName":"weekly"},"frontmatter":{"date":"November 03, 2024","description":"다시 쓰러지고 다시 회복중 🤧","title":"10월 5주차 기록","tags":["weekly"]}},"nextInSameTag":{"fields":{"slug":"/weekly/2024-10-week-3/","langKey":"en","directoryName":"weekly"},"frontmatter":{"date":"October 20, 2024","description":"돌아버린 일교차 🥶","title":"10월 3주차 기록","tags":["weekly"]}},"translationsLink":[]}},"staticQueryHashes":["1522010811","2466007692","2894998521","3765107650","683610688"]}